New warrior skill: forge.

1) FORGE <slot> <race> <ingot> <tier> makes armor from a bar.
   - Light, medium or heavy, sized to any race.
   - Hardness caps the tier; volume decides how much metal it takes.

2) FORGE WEAPON <kind> <ingot> makes weapons.
   - The finer the weapon, the more skill it takes to attempt at all.
   - What comes off the anvil strikes at six sevenths of your level, and
     your level stops counting at 35.

3) FORGE HONE <weapon> is the only way past that.
   - Ten landed strokes buy a point of damage.
   - The ceiling is your level plus a point for every twenty of the skill.

4) FORGE COMBINE <ingot> <ingot> folds two bars of the same metal into
   one larger bar, no worse than the better of the two.

5) FORGE RESIZE <item> <race> refits a finished piece.
   - Growing one needs a bar; shrinking one leaves an offcut carrying
     everything the piece carried but its armor.

See HELP FORGE and HELP AUGMENTATION.
